                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Optional heat load in WATTS this surface emits, instead of a fixed temperature — the nameplate figure for an occupant (~100 W) or a luminaire. OpenFOAM spreads the total over the surface's meshed area, so the wattage stays right however finely it meshes. When set, Temperature is ignored for this wall. A CLOSED Brep (a person, a cabinet) becomes an obstacle carved out of the room with the load on its skin.</item>
